OL,3,AMeloni calls emergency meeting after
OL,4,Aweekend of violent clashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FItalian Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni
OL,7,Fis set to hold an emergency security
OL,8,Fmeeting on Monday after protests over
OL,9,Fthe rising cost of living broke out
OL,10,Finto violent clashes in Milan.
OL,12,FMore than 5,000 people gathered over
OL,13,Fthe weekend. Police deployed tear gas
OL,14,Fand water cannons after protesters -
OL,15,Fmany in masks - threw paving stones,
OL,16,Fbins and chairs at officers.
OL,18,F"To demonstrate is a right. To lay our
OL,19,Fcities to waste is not," Meloni said on
OL,20,FSaturday, adding that "hooligans" had
OL,21,Fexploited the protests to "sow chaos".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
