OL,3,AMeloni calls emergency meeting after
OL,4,Aweekend of violent clashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FRioting and violence have broken out on
OL,7,Fthe sidelines of mostly peaceful
OL,8,Fyouth-led protests in other European
OL,9,Fcountries including France, Spain and
OL,10,FAlbania.
